---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="San Francisco Truck and Commercial Vehicle Accidents Lawyer | Sulfab Law Office"
  description="Injured in a truck accident in San Francisco? Sulfab Law Office helps with severe injuries & compensation claims. Call (415) 360-5266 for a free case review."
>
  <section class="relative bg-dark pt-28 pb-32 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <img src="/assets/images/hero-truck-accident.webp" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center" loading="eager" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-dark/95 via-dark/80 to-slate-900/60"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-dark/20"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full mb-8"></div>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Personal Injury</span>
        <h1 class="text-white text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-6">San Francisco Truck and Commercial Vehicle Accidents Lawyer</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xl md:text-2xl max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-10">A truck accident can change your life in seconds. Because of the massive weight and size of a commercial truck, collisions often result in severe injuries, huge bills and extended time off work. In cases when the collision was caused by the carelessness of another individual, a qualified truck accident lawyer in San Francisco may help you protect your interests and receive compensation.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white/25 text-white hover:border-gold hover:bg-white/5 transition-all rounded-lg">Free Case Review</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-50/50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed font-semibold">Call <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="text-gold hover:underline">(415) 360-5266</a> for a free case review.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 border-t border-slate-100 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[5fr_7fr] gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">After the Crash</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">What to Do After a Truck Accident</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Your actions right after a truck accident might play an important role in your claim. If possible, try to visit a doctor and keep documents or records of your injuries. Photos of the accident site, your injuries, and any vehicle damage will be useful. Also, it would be good to have copies of all your medical bills and other costs related to the accident.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-gold/20">
            <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium">Trucking companies and insurance adjusters might start the investigation of the accident as soon as possible. Important evidence that should be gathered includes the drivers' documents, vehicle history, maintenance records, and more. A truck accident attorney could help you preserve evidence.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[5fr_7fr] gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Complexity</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Why Truck Accident Cases Are More Complex</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">There are several things that make truck accident claims different from ordinary car accident claims. More than one person or company may be responsible for the crash. The truck driver, trucking company, maintenance team, or cargo company could all share liability.</p>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
            <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">An experienced truck accident lawyer in San Francisco knows the California laws and the federal truck regulations. These include rules concerning the number of hours the driver can drive, vehicle maintenance, inspection, and proper loading of cargo.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Common Causes</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Common Causes of Commercial Vehicle Accidents</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">Truck accidents mostly happen because safety guidelines have not been followed. Our legal experts analyze all the factors involved in truck accidents to determine the root cause.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Fatigue from working for many hours</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Distracted driving</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Speeding</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Poor maintenance of the truck</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Overloaded or improperly loaded cargo</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Inexperienced or poorly trained driver</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-slate-500 text-sm mt-8 italic">It is necessary to conduct an investigation to know who is responsible for the accident.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Common Injuries</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Injuries Often Seen in Truck Crashes</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">The impact of a commercial truck can cause life-changing injuries. Victims of truck accidents often require medical attention for an extended period of time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Life-Changing Trauma</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Injuries may consist of head injuries, paralysis, broken bones, internal bleeding, injury to the spine or neck, and burns and more.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Long-Term Impact</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">This type of injury may affect your ability to work, care for your family, or even live a normal life. It is important to calculate your total losses now and in the future.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Financial Recovery</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">What Compensation May Be Available?</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Every case is unique, but there are many possible types of damages that victims of an accident may recover. You may recover:</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2 text-sm">Your medical expenses and future costs</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2 text-sm">The income you have lost</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2 text-sm">Diminished capacity to earn money</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2 text-sm">Suffering and pain</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 1.5-4.5 1.5S9 3 7.5 3A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2 text-sm">Emotional distress</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2 text-sm">Loss of property</h3>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-slate-600 text-sm mt-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Our goal is to recover the full value of your claim, not just the amount an insurance company first offers.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 text-center">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Trusted Advocacy</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Trusted Representation for Accident Victims</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-6 leading-relaxed">Many people search for a car accident lawyer after a crash. However, in commercial vehicle accidents, there are more requirements that must be met. Most commercial carriers usually have insurance companies and good attorneys that represent them in the event of such accidents.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">In case you get into an accident involving a delivery truck, semi-truck, bus, construction vehicle, or any other type of commercial vehicle, The Sulfab Law Office can help you. We will investigate the crash, identify the liable parties and fight for the compensation you deserve.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Questions & Answers</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">FAQ</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-50/50">
          <button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left font-bold text-dark" onclick="this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('hidden'); this.querySelector('svg').classList.toggle('rotate-180')">
            <span>How long do I have to file a claim after a truck accident in California?</span>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold shrink-0 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Generally speaking, in the majority of California truck accidents, you have two years to file a personal injury lawsuit. In case your accident involved a vehicle owned by the government, you should act within six months.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-50/50">
          <button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left font-bold text-dark" onclick="this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('hidden'); this.querySelector('svg').classList.toggle('rotate-180')">
            <span>Which truck safety rules should I know about?</span>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold shrink-0 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Commercial trucking companies have to comply with the federal safety regulations established by the FMCSA. The FMCSA safety rules relate to drivers' working hours, truck inspection, maintenance, drug testing, and proper cargo loading.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-50/50">
          <button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left font-bold text-dark" onclick="this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('hidden'); this.querySelector('svg').classList.toggle('rotate-180')">
            <span>Am I eligible for compensation if I had any fault?</span>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold shrink-0 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Yes. California applies the pure comparative negligence rule. You will still get compensation regardless of your fault in the incident. Only the total amount of compensation is decreased based on your percentage of fault.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-50/50">
          <button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left font-bold text-dark" onclick="this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('hidden'); this.querySelector('svg').classList.toggle('rotate-180')">
            <span>Is it good to accept the first offer from the insurance company?</span>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold shrink-0 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            In most cases, it is good to analyze any compensation settlement before accepting it. The initial offer may not take into account medical expenses, loss of wages and other damages. Consulting a lawyer can clarify the real worth of your compensation.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-dark border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4 italic font-serif">Speak With a Lawyer Today</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mb-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Do not wait to protect your rights. Evidence can disappear quickly after a crash, and deadlines apply to personal injury claims. Whether you were hurt in a truck crash or need help after a commercial vehicle accident, a truck accident attorney in San Francisco can explain your legal options.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Our team will listen to your concerns, answer to your questions and provide the legal guidance you need throughout your case. Call The Sulfab Law Office today at <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="text-gold hover:underline">(415) 360-5266</a> for your free consultation.</p>
      <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
